{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_09_title", "source_sha256": "da8c5a19a9aa7e3a0f025502c5ee9009e3ad052cb5ae4ced8bb08f198833dbaa", "ja": "いつかは果てない月までも", "zh": "终有一天直至无垠明月", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_09_synopsis", "source_sha256": "9489303bcca1acefecd44a49e169332b87746d69c199f0f06840a9227f2ccdd2", "ja": "南エリアでの舞台劇公演が終わり、アイドル\n達は満足げ。摩訶不思議な月の宝について話\nを弾ませる。プロデューサーはそんな一同を\n見守りながら、さらなる飛躍のために、気合\nいを入れなおすのだった。", "zh": "南区的舞台剧公演结束了，偶像\n们一脸满足。大家兴致勃勃地谈论着\n神秘莫测的月之宝物。制作人守望着\n这一行人，为了更进一步的发展重新振作起精神。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_09_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3fb328fef4130881b2b06c65fe2dba4e5820f583ffe72e0f42c3379d8f45b8ae", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさま！\n南エリアでの演劇メイン公演、大成功だな！", "zh": "大家辛苦了！\n南区的戏剧主打公演，大获成功啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_09_1001_007ior", "source_sha256": "99ccbf55ab21ac5e52e5e50bcfe88dd96c5d1528d6c0823736a4ab6150ace085", "ja": "当然じゃない♪　なんといっても\nこの伊織ちゃんが主役を張ったんですもの！", "zh": "那是当然的啦♪ 毕竟\n可是由我伊织担纲主演的呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_09_1002_052kao", "source_sha256": "107f67fee8d3573b5d571eaa9faa53c3615bf4af33637b5eb7a7762193ddfdfb", "ja": "私も、怪盗を演じられて楽しかったです♪\n名前を覚えるのに、すこし苦労しましたけど……。", "zh": "我也很开心能饰演怪盗♪不过，为了记住名字，稍微费了点功夫……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_09_1003_p", "source_sha256": "691ee55dff8a8066b1472a323a7f1a269734cc4d763e34ad08393dd4da717884", "ja": "今回は役名がついてましたからね。\n月の宝とかもあるし……。", "zh": "这次可是有角色名的嘛。\n而且还有月之宝藏什么的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_09_1004_042miy", "source_sha256": "e3a59a4956d8f5bfe0ef197cb14ceb10fc646e3ab7dc807ba83d2fab337af403", "ja": "台本を読みながら、ドキドキしましたよ～。\n月のお宝が本当にあったら、大変ですな～。", "zh": "读剧本的时候，我心里扑通扑通直跳呢～。\n要是月亮上的宝物真的存在，那可就不得了啦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_09_1005_007ior", "source_sha256": "9de2880a598858fbb969327e9026ed835049ecda8a080e5b8ba15b002bae445b", "ja": "でも、歌織が持っていた\nデータ探索できる宝とか、便利そうじゃない？", "zh": "不过，歌织拿着的那个能探索数据的宝物，不是看起来挺方便的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_09_1006_049mom", "source_sha256": "bd1137d9ab422a3946dfe070d738ce7bbc3960a73cff6a9bd678ed8da0e6f48f", "ja": "だったら桃子は、伊織さんの力がほしいかな。\n大人にも負けないパワーなんて、かっこいいし。", "zh": "那桃子想要的，是伊织小姐的力量吧。\n连大人都不输的力量，很帅气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_09_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "53ed18b9f9739e279d813a3f33d86a4616e5acbc4d7a9d02d702ba8d75edfb4d", "ja": "私は……月に行ってみたいです♪", "zh": "我……想去月球看看♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_09_1008_049mom", "source_sha256": "57b270694f540e062fa5677d35f5627508968914ecab5cdc23ad4ce8102bf59c", "ja": "月に行くって……未来さん、\nいま、月の宝の話をしてたんだよ？", "zh": "去月亮……未来，\n我们刚才说的是月亮上的宝藏哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_09_1009_014mir", "source_sha256": "aeada93da53298eab5568c7bb356324cc0ebe7181c79d9dddb543bf20335a346", "ja": "うん！　でも、他にももっと、\nいろんな宝物があるかもしれないでしょ？", "zh": "嗯！不过，说不定还有更多各种各样的宝物，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_09_1010_014mir", "source_sha256": "2a8c10f9a545982096f3e22c3b03266e8d605a79baea267f2da98753dc396dd6", "ja": "だから、月に行って確かめたいなって♪", "zh": "所以，我想去月球确认一下♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_09_1011_052kao", "source_sha256": "ef1f7c08bf6889c865ad9074e79676f1d5ac96f3b525ec53fd7965230e1e6538", "ja": "ふふっ、未来ちゃんはすごいわね。\nでもたしかに、月に行ってみたいかも。", "zh": "呵呵，未来真厉害呢。\n不过，我确实也有点想去月球看看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_09_1012_042miy", "source_sha256": "069cddb0eca59a1ee4d2ccaa63b4929a09037224909d026854be12c054e24655", "ja": "ではその時は、みんなで行きましょう～。\n月兎隊で、お宝を探しますよ～。むふふ。", "zh": "那么到时候，大家一起去吧～  \n组成月兔队，一起去寻找宝藏吧～哼哼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_09_1013_p", "source_sha256": "f80ef2835cf145a0dda3f2e6b78c399264d8004f6ac8bce22ca4c245f7c9035e", "ja": "（月に行く、か……一見途方もないけれど、\nでも無謀だとは不思議と思えないな……）", "zh": "（去月球吗……乍一看确实匪夷所思，可不知为何，我并不觉得这是鲁莽之举……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_09_1014_p", "source_sha256": "612686b389c52ed90fd9a2defc84035bce4f5800caf2dfc155e69d17e8cebb22", "ja": "（いつか、みんなは月に届かんばかりに\n飛躍してくれる……そう信じているからな！）", "zh": "（因为我相信，总有一天，大家一定会飞跃到几乎触及月亮的高度……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
